  "description": "Jun-ho inherits his late Uncle Deok-chun's food truck. He travels the country, cooking to make the name \"Go Deok-chun\" known nationwide. Starting with Se-hee, the heir to a conglomerate, Jun-ho gets involved with women who each have their own stories in every region he visits! They all fall for him, but the one thing that truly captures Jun-ho's heart... is cooking! Follow the irresistible Jun-ho on his nationwide romantic food truck journey-business, let's begin!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
